{
  "_comment": "Settings for sessions on the BestPractice repo itself, instantiated from templates/harness/claude-code/settings.json. This repo IS the source of that template, so a drift between the two is this repo failing to run what it ships -- which is exactly what it was doing until 2026-09-06: no PreToolUse hook at all (the path-triggered loading channel, unrun in the repo that defines it) and an allowlist that still named process/upstream/tools/ paths this repo does not have. Adapted from the template only where this repo genuinely differs: its own tools live at tools/ (so the process/upstream/ entries are dropped, not kept as dead weight) and it has a deck builder nobody else does. 2026-09-06: freshness-guard.sh and commit-identity.sh added from the same template. The base branch passed to the guard is precedent-beta-v01, NOT this repo's configured default -- which is exactly the repo the template's own comment warns about, and the reason the base is an explicit argument rather than something detected. No env TZ is set here: this repo has more than one person committing to it, and the guard's identity hook resolves each of them (and their declared timezone, where they have one) at session start instead.",
  "permissions": {
    "allow": [
      "Bash(grep *)",
      "Bash(git fetch *)",
      "Bash(git status)",
      "Bash(git status *)",
      "Bash(git log *)",
      "Bash(git diff *)",
      "Bash(git show *)",
      "Bash(git branch *)",
      "Bash(git switch *)",
      "Bash(git merge *)",
      "Bash(git add *)",
      "Bash(git commit *)",
      "Bash(git push -u origin *)",
      "Bash(git check-ignore *)",
      "Bash(git check-attr *)",
      "Bash(python3 tools/precedent_show.py)",
      "Bash(python3 tools/precedent_show.py *)",
      "Bash(python3 tools/precedent_paths.py)",
      "Bash(python3 tools/precedent_paths.py *)",
      "Bash(python3 tools/precedent_gate.py)",
      "Bash(python3 tools/precedent_gate.py *)",
      "Bash(python3 tools/precedent_check.py)",
      "Bash(python3 tools/precedent_check.py *)",
      "Bash(python3 tools/precedent_sync_views.py)",
      "Bash(python3 tools/precedent_sync_views.py *)",
      "Bash(python3 tools/routing_audit.py)",
      "Bash(python3 tools/routing_audit.py *)",
      "Bash(python3 tools/doc_lint.py)",
      "Bash(python3 tools/doc_lint.py *)",
      "Bash(python3 tools/doc_sync.py)",
      "Bash(python3 tools/doc_sync.py *)",
      "Bash(bash tools/bootstrap.sh)",
      "Bash(python3 tools/practice_audit.py)",
      "Bash(python3 tools/practice_audit.py *)",
      "Bash(python3 tools/verify_harness.py)",
      "Bash(python3 tools/verify_harness.py *)",
      "Bash(python3 tools/build_views.py)",
      "Bash(python3 tools/build_views.py *)",
      "Bash(python3 tools/catalogue_stats.py)",
      "Bash(python3 tools/leak_gate.py)",
      "Bash(python3 tools/leak_gate.py *)",
      "Bash(python3 deck/build_deck.py *)"
    ]
  },
  "hooks": {
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/hooks/session-start.sh"
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/hooks/freshness-guard.sh session-start precedent-beta-v01"
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/hooks/commit-identity.sh"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "UserPromptSubmit": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/hooks/freshness-guard.sh user-prompt precedent-beta-v01"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Edit|Write|NotebookEdit",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/hooks/precedent-paths.sh"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Edit|Write|NotebookEdit|Bash",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/hooks/freshness-guard.sh pre-write precedent-beta-v01"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "Stop": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/hooks/stop-git-check.sh"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
